// Title: LiveKD Driver Creation By Uncommon Process
// ID: 059c5af9-5131-4d8d-92b2-de4ad6146712
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-05-16
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.stealth
// Description: Detects the creation of the LiveKD driver by a process image other than "livekd.exe".
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(TargetFilename = "C:\\Windows\\System32\\drivers\\LiveKdD.SYS")) AND NOT (((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\livekd.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\livek64.exe")))))
